Graph Theory and Probabilistic Combinatorics, Trinity Term; Friday 5 June 2009, 9.30am–12.30pm. This combined Part C paper was shared by Mathematics, Mathematics and Computer Science, and Mathematics and Statistics. Both sections and all six questions are covered below; the complete four-page source is retained in a private editable transcription. The source was supplied through https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/maths_past_papers_3[the past-papers disclosure], in original Part C bundle pages 286–289. No exact worked-answer advertisement was found in the bounded check.

